OL,2,W5h 55h 55hp5S||,||h|<,|4||   ||h|<,,$
OL,3,W5h"55h"55j/5S jwss1zubss{5
OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,6, Main points in Labour Party election
OL,7, manifesto:
OL,9,F- Bring inflation down to 5% by 1982 -
OL,10,F- Strengthen the Price Commission -
OL,11,F- Seek radical reform of the EEC
OL,12,F  agricultural policy -
OL,13,F- Pursue policies for full employment -
OL,14,F- Reduce income tax including tax
OL,15,F  threshold -
OL,16,F- Introduce wealth tax for those with
OL,17,  Ftotal personal wealth of #15O,OOO+ -
OL,18,F- Set up a new body to ensure private
OL,19,F  and public sector pay comparability -
OL,20,F- Attack tax evasion -
OL,21,F- Curtail powers of House of Lords -
OL,22,F- Improve educational opportunities -
OL,23,                        FFromG06-04-79
