OL,6, Main points in Labour Party election
OL,7, manifesto:
OL,9,F- Strengthen National Enterprise Board-
OL,10,F- Seek planning agreements -
OL,11,F- Abolish Health Service charges -
OL,12,F- Develop Giro to compete with banks -
OL,13,F- Increase statf stake in North Sea oil
OL,14,F- Raise old age pensions in November to
OL,15,F  #35 for couple, #22 for single person
OL,16,F- Seek to set up acceptable Scottish
OL,17,  FAssembly -
OL,18,F- Expand training - retraining schemes
OL,19,F- Achieve growth in economy of 3% or
OL,20,F  more annually -
OL,21,F- Child benefit to go up to #4.5O in
OL,22,  FNovember-
OL,23,                        FFromG06-04-79
