OL,6, Scotland Yard believe they now know the
OL,7, identity of the man who killed Mr Airey
OL,8, Neave.
OL,10,FIt is thought he could well be
OL,11,Fresponsible for other murders -
OL,12,Fincluding that of the British
OL,13,FAmbassador in Dublin.
OL,15,FDetectives led by the head of the Anti-
OL,16,FTerrorist Squad, Commander Peter Duffy,
OL,17,Fare anxious to trace a number of men -
OL,18,Fpossibly as many as six or seven - who
OL,19,Fhave been linked with acts of terrorism
OL,20,Fin recent years.
OL,22,FThere was tight security at Mr Neave's
OL,23,Ffuneral today near his Oxfordshire home
OL,24,ANext PageBT'text FilesCRewindFReg Radio
