OL,4,W-,,%-,,%-,,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,$
OL,6, The BBC has offered its 26,OOO staff a
OL,7, nine percent pay rise under phase four
OL,8, of the government's pay policy.
OL,10,FIf the offer is accepted, it will take
OL,11,Feffect from the beginning of April in a
OL,12,Fmove to merge the pay agreement dates
OL,13,Fof monthly- and weekly-paid staff.
OL,15,FThe deal includes a lump-sum payment -
OL,16,Fto compensate for the adjustment in
OL,17,Fpay bargaining dates.
OL,19,FHome Office approval has already been
OL,20,Fsecured for the offer.
OL,23,                        FFromG06-04-79
