OL,6,S/GPresident KaundaBhas said that the
OL,7,BBritish editor of a farming magazine in
OL,8,BZambia is to be deported. Mr William
OL,9,BKerrigan had written an editorial
OL,10,Bdemanding action against black
OL,11,BRhodesian guerrillas based in Zambia.
OL,13,S/GSeven Spanish fishermenBwere missing,
OL,14,Bfeared drowned, after their boat was
OL,15,Bsliced in two in a collision with a
OL,16,Bmotor vessel off Barcelona.
OL,18,S/GThe rulingBNational Party in South
OL,19,BAfrica has expelled Mr Connie Mulder,
OL,20,Bover his role in the "slush funds"
OL,21,Bscandal. He was formerly Minister of
OL,22,BInformation.
OL,23,                     B   FromG06-04-79
